{"id":"the-hub","title":"The Hub","category":"skyblock","icon":"minecraft:oak_sapling","summary":"Hypixel's own Hub island, with the Village and the areas around it (Graveyard, Coal Mine, Farm, Forest, Ruins, Mountain, Wizard Tower, Wilderness and more), their mobs and resources, the launch pads and the Fairy Souls.","blocks":[{"t":"p","s":[{"x":"The "},{"x":"Hub","b":true},{"x":" is where everyone meets. It's "},{"x":"Hypixel's own Hub map","b":true},{"x":", as it was in autumn 2022: the "},{"x":"Village","b":true},{"x":" in the middle, with the shops, the Bank, the Auction House and the elections hall, and the areas all around it. The sidebar shows the area you're in."}]},{"t":"table","head":[[{"x":"Area"}],[{"x":"Where"}],[{"x":"What it's for"}]],"rows":[[[{"x":"Village","link":"the-hub#village"}],[{"x":"the middle"}],[{"x":"Shops, the Bank, the Auction House, the elections, the Dungeon Hub fountain"}]],[[{"x":"Coal Mine","link":"the-hub#coal-mine"}],[{"x":"north"}],[{"x":"Mining: Coal and Stone; the way to the Gold Mine"}]],[[{"x":"Farm","link":"the-hub#farm"}],[{"x":"north-east"}],[{"x":"Farming: Wheat; the way to The Barn"}]],[[{"x":"Graveyard","link":"the-hub#graveyard"}],[{"x":"north-west"}],[{"x":"Combat: Graveyard Zombies, Zombie Villagers at night; the Hub Crypts below"}]],[[{"x":"Forest","link":"the-hub#forest"}],[{"x":"west"}],[{"x":"Foraging: Oak trees; the way to The Park"}]],[[{"x":"Ruins","link":"the-hub#ruins"}],[{"x":"far west"}],[{"x":"Combat: Wolves and Old Wolves"}]],[[{"x":"Mountain","link":"the-hub#mountain"}],[{"x":"south"}],[{"x":"Climbing, Carrots at its foot"}]],[[{"x":"Wizard Tower","link":"the-hub#wizard-tower"}],[{"x":"south-east of the Mountain"}],[{"x":"The way into the Rift"}]],[[{"x":"Fisherman's Hut","link":"the-hub#fisherman-s-hut"}],[{"x":"east"}],[{"x":"Fishing on the lake"}]],[[{"x":"Wilderness","link":"the-hub#wilderness"}],[{"x":"south and south-east"}],[{"x":"The Fairy Pond, the Dark Auction"}]],[[{"x":"Colosseum","link":"the-hub#colosseum"}],[{"x":"far south-east"}],[{"x":"Lucius, Shifty"}]]],"align":["l","l","l"]},{"t":"p","s":[{"x":"Breaking blocks is only allowed where an area lets you: the Coal Mine's Coal Ore and Stone, the Farm's Wheat, the Forest's Oak logs and leaves, the Mountain's Carrots. What you break grows back after a few seconds, so there's always more. Everything else in the Hub is protected."}]},{"t":"h2","text":"The mobs","anchor":"the-mobs"},{"t":"p","s":[{"x":"The Hub's mobs have Hypixel's names and stats. Killing one pays its "},{"x":"Combat XP","b":true},{"x":" and "},{"x":"coins","b":true},{"x":" straight into your purse, and counts for "},{"x":"slayer quests","link":"slayers"},{"x":" (a Crypt Ghoul adds its 36 Combat XP to a Revenant Horror quest, not a plain zombie's 6). None of them burn in daylight."}]},{"t":"table","head":[[{"x":"Mob"}],[{"x":"Where"}],[{"x":"Level"}],[{"x":"Health"}],[{"x":"Damage"}],[{"x":"Combat XP"}],[{"x":"Coins"}]],"rows":[[[{"x":"Graveyard Zombie"}],[{"x":"Graveyard"}],[{"x":"1"}],[{"x":"100"}],[{"x":"20"}],[{"x":"6"}],[{"x":"1"}]],[[{"x":"Zombie Villager"}],[{"x":"Graveyard, at night"}],[{"x":"1"}],[{"x":"120"}],[{"x":"24"}],[{"x":"7"}],[{"x":"1"}]],[[{"x":"Crypt Ghoul"}],[{"x":"Hub Crypts"}],[{"x":"30"}],[{"x":"2,000"}],[{"x":"350"}],[{"x":"36"}],[{"x":"13"}]],[[{"x":"Golden Ghoul"}],[{"x":"Hub Crypts (one at a time)"}],[{"x":"50"}],[{"x":"45,000"}],[{"x":"800"}],[{"x":"50"}],[{"x":"100"}]],[[{"x":"Wolf"}],[{"x":"Ruins"}],[{"x":"15"}],[{"x":"250"}],[{"x":"90"}],[{"x":"15"}],[{"x":"1"}]],[[{"x":"Old Wolf"}],[{"x":"Ruins (two at a time)"}],[{"x":"50"}],[{"x":"15,000"}],[{"x":"720"}],[{"x":"40"}],[{"x":"40"}]]],"align":["l","l","l","l","l","l","l"]},{"t":"p","s":[{"x":"The Ruins' wolves attack anyone who comes near. Night mobs leave at sunrise. During the "},{"x":"Spooky Festival","link":"calendar-and-events#the-spooky-festival"},{"x":", Spooky mobs come out at night in the Graveyard and the Wilderness."}]},{"t":"h2","text":"Village","anchor":"village"},{"t":"p","s":[{"x":"Where you arrive ("},{"x":"/warp hub","c":true},{"x":"): the square, with the "},{"x":"Bank","b":true},{"x":" (the gold rotunda, with the "},{"x":"Banker","b":true},{"x":"), the "},{"x":"Auction House","b":true},{"x":" to the west, the "},{"x":"Library","b":true},{"x":" (the "},{"x":"Librarian","b":true},{"x":", and "},{"x":"Seraphine Vael","b":true},{"x":" by the enchanting table), the "},{"x":"Blacksmith","b":true},{"x":" and his street (the "},{"x":"Weaponsmith","b":true},{"x":", the "},{"x":"Mine Merchant","b":true},{"x":", "},{"x":"Rosetta","b":true},{"x":") to the north, and the elections hall ("},{"x":"Clerk Seraphine","b":true},{"x":", and the Mayor) north of the square. The fountain by the square is the "},{"x":"portal to the Dungeon Hub","b":true},{"x":": walk in."}]},{"t":"p","s":[{"x":"Event visitors stand on the square too: the "},{"x":"Fear Mongerer","b":true},{"x":" during the Spooky Festival, "},{"x":"Oringo","b":true},{"x":" with the Traveling Zoo, the "},{"x":"Baker","b":true},{"x":" at the New Year."}]},{"t":"h2","text":"Coal Mine","anchor":"coal-mine"},{"t":"p","s":[{"x":"North of the village: open veins of "},{"x":"Coal Ore","b":true},{"x":" and "},{"x":"Stone","b":true},{"x":" (they become bedrock for a few seconds when mined). At the far end, a launch pad takes you to the "},{"x":"Gold Mine","link":"the-islands#gold-mine"},{"x":" (needs Mining I)."}]},{"t":"h2","text":"Farm","anchor":"farm"},{"t":"p","s":[{"x":"North-east of the village: fields of "},{"x":"Wheat","b":true},{"x":" that grow back, the "},{"x":"Farmer","b":true},{"x":", "},{"x":"Arthur","b":true},{"x":" (minions) and the "},{"x":"Farm Merchant","b":true},{"x":". A launch pad at the north end takes you to "},{"x":"The Barn","link":"the-islands#the-barn"},{"x":" (needs Farming I)."}]},{"t":"h2","text":"Graveyard","anchor":"graveyard"},{"t":"p","s":[{"x":"North-west of the village, dark under its dead trees: "},{"x":"Pat","b":true},{"x":"'s house, the "},{"x":"Tavern","b":true},{"x":" (the "},{"x":"Bartender","b":true},{"x":", "},{"x":"Maddox the Slayer","b":true},{"x":"), and the graves. A launch pad at the back takes you to the "},{"x":"Spider's Den","link":"the-islands#spider-s-den"},{"x":" (needs Combat I)."}]},{"t":"p","s":[{"x":"Below it run the "},{"x":"Hub Crypts","b":true},{"x":", where "},{"x":"Crypt Ghouls","b":true},{"x":" roam and a "},{"x":"Golden Ghoul","b":true},{"x":" waits. "},{"x":"/warp crypt","c":true},{"x":" takes you there once you've been. Revenant Horror quests are best done here."}]},{"t":"h2","text":"Forest","anchor":"forest"},{"t":"p","s":[{"x":"West of the village: "},{"x":"Oak","b":true},{"x":" trees whose logs and leaves grow back, the "},{"x":"Lumber Jack","b":true},{"x":" and the "},{"x":"Lumber Merchant","b":true},{"x":". At its west edge a launch pad takes you to "},{"x":"The Park","link":"the-islands#the-park"},{"x":" (needs Foraging I)."}]},{"t":"h2","text":"Ruins","anchor":"ruins"},{"t":"p","s":[{"x":"Far west, past the Park's launch pad: the old castle, where "},{"x":"Wolves","b":true},{"x":" and "},{"x":"Old Wolves","b":true},{"x":" roam, so Sven Packmaster quests are done here. The "},{"x":"Lonely Philosopher","b":true},{"x":" stands on a tower. "},{"x":"/warp castle","c":true},{"x":" takes you here once you've visited."}]},{"t":"h2","text":"Mountain","anchor":"mountain"},{"t":"p","s":[{"x":"The snowy mountain south of the village. "},{"x":"Scoop","b":true},{"x":" lives near the top, and "},{"x":"Carrots","b":true},{"x":" grow at its foot."}]},{"t":"h2","text":"Wizard Tower","anchor":"wizard-tower"},{"t":"p","s":[{"x":"The round tower with the purple roof, south-east of the Mountain. The "},{"x":"Wizard","b":true},{"x":" waits on its top floor beside the portal to "},{"x":"the Rift","link":"the-rift"},{"x":". "},{"x":"/warp wizard","c":true},{"x":" takes you to its door."}]},{"t":"h2","text":"Fisherman's Hut","anchor":"fisherman-s-hut"},{"t":"p","s":[{"x":"East of the village, on the lake: the "},{"x":"Fishing Merchant","b":true},{"x":" and "},{"x":"Fisherman Gerald","b":true},{"x":"."}]},{"t":"h2","text":"Wilderness","anchor":"wilderness"},{"t":"p","s":[{"x":"South and south-east: the "},{"x":"Fairy Pond","b":true},{"x":" with "},{"x":"Tia the Fairy","b":true},{"x":", and the "},{"x":"Dark Auction","b":true},{"x":", with "},{"x":"Sirius","b":true},{"x":" at its door. "},{"x":"/warp da","c":true},{"x":" takes you there once you've visited."}]},{"t":"h2","text":"Colosseum","anchor":"colosseum"},{"t":"p","s":[{"x":"The arena in the far south-east: "},{"x":"Lucius","b":true},{"x":" and "},{"x":"Shifty","b":true},{"x":"."}]},{"t":"h2","text":"Fairy Souls","anchor":"fairy-souls"},{"t":"p","s":[{"x":"79 Fairy Souls","b":true},{"x":" are hidden around the Hub, where Hypixel hid them: small glowing pink crystals, on rooftops, under bridges, in the crypts and up the mountain. A soul you haven't found yet sparkles. Click one to collect it: \""},{"x":"SOUL!","b":true},{"x":" You found a Fairy Soul!\", with how many you have on the Hub and in total. Each profile finds its own."}]},{"t":"p","s":[{"x":"Bring them to "},{"x":"Tia the Fairy","b":true},{"x":" at the Fairy Pond. She exchanges them five at a time: each exchange gives "},{"x":"10 SkyBlock XP","b":true},{"x":" (see "},{"x":"SkyBlock Leveling","link":"skyblock-leveling"},{"x":")."}]},{"t":"callout","kind":"note","b":[{"t":"p","s":[{"x":"On Hypixel some exchanges also unlock Backpack slots; that comes with backpacks. The other islands have their own souls (see "},{"x":"The Islands","link":"the-islands#fairy-souls"},{"x":"); Tia takes them all."}]}]},{"t":"h2","text":"Warps","anchor":"warps"},{"t":"table","head":[[{"x":"Warp"}],[{"x":"Goes to"}],[{"x":"Unlocks when you first visit"}]],"rows":[[[{"x":"/warp hub","c":true}],[{"x":"the village square"}],[{"x":"always open"}]],[[{"x":"/warp crypt","c":true}],[{"x":"the Hub Crypts"}],[{"x":"the Crypts"}]],[[{"x":"/warp castle","c":true}],[{"x":"the Ruins"}],[{"x":"the Ruins"}]],[[{"x":"/warp da","c":true}],[{"x":"the Dark Auction"}],[{"x":"the Wilderness"}]],[[{"x":"/warp wizard","c":true}],[{"x":"the Wizard Tower"}],[{"x":"the Wizard Tower"}]]],"align":["l","l","l"]},{"t":"p","s":[{"x":"See also "},{"x":"Profiles and islands","link":"profiles-and-islands"},{"x":", "},{"x":"Slayers","link":"slayers"},{"x":" and "},{"x":"Collections","link":"collections"},{"x":"."}]}]}